# Snapshot SVGs are regenerated wholesale on every change (coordinates,
# ids, etc. all shift), so a line-by-line diff is noise. -diff makes local
# git tooling (git diff/log -p) treat them as opaque binaries; GitHub's web
# UI doesn't honour -diff (it diffs anything that looks like text), so
# linguist-generated also collapses them behind a "Load diff" toggle there
# and drops them from the PR's diff stats.
tests/testthat/_snaps/**/*.svg -diff linguist-generated=true
